Struggling with what to get for someone on your Christmas list? 

The agents are here to help! 

@omooretweets and I drafted 13 agents to find gifts for everyone on your list - from the friend always monitoring the situation to the dad who says he doesn't want anything 👇

@omooretweets Of course, the website includes a deep dive into the agents' 900 selections.

Which gifts were the most popular? Which agents suggested the most expensive items? 

Who overlapped the most - and the least - in their picks?
